An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nA shady-looking pair of glasses\nthat boosts DARK-type moves.

#org @gItemDescription_BlackBelt
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nA belt that boosts determination\nand FIGHTING-type moves.

#org @gItemDescription_Magnet
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nA powerful magnet that boosts the\npower of ELECTRIC-type moves.

#org @gItemDescription_MysticWater
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nA teardrop-shaped gem that boosts\nthe power of WATER-type moves.

#org @gItemDescription_SharpBeak
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nA long, sharp beak that boosts the\npower of FLYING-type moves.

#org @gItemDescription_PoisonBarb
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nA small, poisonous barb that boosts\nthe power of POISON-type moves.

#org @gItemDescription_NeverMeltIce
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nA piece of ice that repels heat\nand boosts ICE-type moves.

#org @gItemDescription_SpellTag
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nA sinister, eerie tag that boosts\nGHOST-type moves.

#org @gItemDescription_TwistedSpoon
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nA spoon imbued with telekinetic\npower boosts PSYCHIC-type moves.

#org @gItemDescription_Charcoal
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nA combustible fuel that boosts the\npower of FIRE-type moves.

#org @gItemDescription_DragonFang
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nA hard and sharp fang that boosts\nthe power of DRAGON-type moves.

#org @gItemDescription_SilkScarf
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nA sumptuous scarf that boosts the\npower of NORMAL-type moves.

#org @gItemDescription_UpGrade
A transparent device filled with all\nsorts of data.\nIt is made by SILPH CO.

#org @gItemDescription_ShellBell
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nThe holding POK\eMON regains some\nHP upon striking the foe.

#org @gItemDescription_SeaIncense
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nIt slightly boosts the power of\nWATER-type moves.

#org @gItemDescription_LaxIncense
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nIts tricky aroma slightly reduces\nthe foe's accuracy.

#org @gItemDescription_LuckyPunch
A glove to be held by a CHANSEY.\nIt raises CHANSEY's critical-hit\nratio.

#org @gItemDescription_MetalPowder
A fine, hard powder to be held by\na DITTO.\nIt raises DITTO's DEFENSE stat.

#org @gItemDescription_ThickClub
A hard bone of some sort to be\nheld by a CUBONE or MAROWAK.\nIt raises the ATTACK stat.

#org @gItemDescription_Leek
A stick of leek to be held by a\nFARFETCH'D. It raises FARFETCH'D's\ncritical-hit ratio.

#org @gItemDescription_StrawberrySweet
A strawberry-shaped sweet.\nWhen a MILCERY holds this, it will\nspin around happily.

#org @gItemDescription_BerrySweet
A berry-shaped sweet.\nWhen a MILCERY holds this, it will\nspin around happily.

#org @gItemDescription_LoveSweet
A heart-shaped sweet.\nWhen a MILCERY holds this, it will\nspin around happily.

#org @gItemDescription_CloverSweet
A clover-shaped sweet.\nWhen a MILCERY holds this, it will\nspin around happily.

#org @gItemDescription_FlowerSweet
A flower-shaped sweet.\nWhen a MILCERY holds this, it will\nspin around happily.

#org @gItemDescription_RibbonSweet
A ribbon-shaped sweet.\nWhen a MILCERY holds this, it will\nspin around happily.

#org @gItemDescription_StarSweet
A star-shaped sweet.\nWhen a MILCERY holds this, it will\nspin around happily.

#org @gItemDescription_SweetApple
A peculiar apple that can make\na certain species of POK\eMON\nevolve. It's exceptionally sweet.

#org @gItemDescription_TartApple
A peculiar apple that can make\na certain species of POK\eMON\nevolve. It's exceptionally tart.

#org @gItemDescription_CrackedPot
A cracked teapot that can make a\ncertain species of POK\eMON evolve.\nTea poured from it is delicious.

#org @gItemDescription_ChippedPot
A chipped teapot that can make a\ncertain species of POK\eMON evolve.\nTea poured from it is delicious.

#org @gItemDescription_GalaricaCuff
A cuff made from woven-together\nGALARICA TWIGS. Giving it to certain\nPOK\eMON will make them happy.

#org @gItemDescription_GalaricaWreath
A crown made from woven-together\nGALARICA TWIGS. Giving it to certain\nPOK\eMON will make them happy.

#org @gItemDescription_CherishBall
A quite rare BALL that has been\nspecially crafted to commemorate\nan ocassion of some sort.

#org @gItemDescription_DuskBall
A BALL that makes it easier to\ncatch wild POK\eMON at night or\nin dark places such as caves.

#org @gItemDescription_HealBall
A BALL that restores the caught\nPOK\eMON's HP and eliminates\nany status problem.

#org @gItemDescription_QuickBall
A BALL that provides a better\ncatch rate if it is used at the\nstart of a wild encounter.

#org @gItemDescription_FastBall
A BALL that makes it easier to\ncatch POK\eMON which are quick to\nrun away.

#org @gItemDescription_LevelBall
A BALL that makes it easier to\ncatch POK\eMON that are a lower\nlevel than your own.

#org @gItemDescription_LureBall
A BALL that is good for catching\nPOK\eMON that you reel in with a\nRod while out fishing.

#org @gItemDescription_HeavyBall
A BALL that is better than usual\nat catching very large and heavy\nPOK\eMON.

#org @gItemDescription_LoveBall
A BALL for catching POK\eMON that\nare the opposite gender of your\nPOK\eMON.

#org @gItemDescription_FriendBall
A BALL that will make the wild\nPOK\eMON caught with it more\nfriendly toward you.

#org @gItemDescription_MoonBall
A BALL that will make it easier to\ncatch POK\eMON that can evolve\nusing a MOON STONE.

#org @gItemDescription_SportBall
A special POK\e BALL that is\nused during the BUG-CATCHING\nCONTEST.

#org @gItemDescription_BeastBall
A BALL designed to catch ULTRA\nBEASTS. It has a low success rate\nfor catching others.

#org @gItemDescription_DreamBall
A BALL that makes it easier to\ncatch wild POK\eMON while it is\nasleep.

#org @gItemDescription_ParkBall
A special POK\e BALL for\nthe PAL PARK.

#org @gItemDescription_RedScarf
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nIt boosts the holding POK\eMON's\nCOOL condition in CONTESTS.

#org @gItemDescription_BlueScarf
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nIt boosts the holding POK\eMON's\nBEAUTY condition in CONTESTS.

#org @gItemDescription_PinkScarf
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nIt boosts the holding POK\eMON's\nCUTE condition in CONTESTS.

#org @gItemDescription_GreenScarf
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nIt boosts the holding POK\eMON's\nSMART condition in CONTESTS.

#org @gItemDescription_YellowScarf
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nIt boosts the holding POK\eMON's\nTOUGH condition in CONTESTS.

#org @gItemDescription_MachBike
A folding bicycle that is at least\ntwice as fast as walking.

#org @gItemDescription_CoinCase
A case for holding COINS obtained\nat the GAME CORNER.\nIt holds up to 9,999 COINS.

#org @gItemDescription_Itemfinder
A device used for finding items.\nIf there is a hidden item nearby\nwhen it is used, it emits a signal.

#org @gItemDescription_OldRod
An old and beat-up fishing rod.\nUse it by any body of water to \nfish for wild POK\eMON.

#org @gItemDescription_GoodRod
A new, good-quality fishing rod.\nUse it by any body of water to \nfish for wild POK\eMON.

#org @gItemDescription_SuperRod
An awesome, high-tech fishing rod.\nUse it by any body of water to fish\nfor wild POK\eMON.

#org @gItemDescription_SsTicket
The ticket required for sailing on\nthe ferry S.S. ANNE.\nIt has a drawing of a ship on it.

#org @gItemDescription_ContestPass
The pass required for entering\nPOK\eMON CONTESTS. It has a\ndrawing of an award ribbon on it.

#org @gItemDescription_ZPowerRing
A mysterious ring that enables\nthe use of Z-POWER. It requires the\nwillpower of the trainer wearing it.    

#org @gItemDescription_WailmerPail
A nifty watering pail.\nUse it to promote strong growth in\nBERRIES planted in soft soil.

#org @gItemDescription_DevonGoods
A package that contains mechanical\nparts of some sort made by the\nDEVON CORPORATION.

#org @gItemDescription_SootSack
A sack used to collect volcanic\nash automatically during walks\nover deep ash.

#org @gItemDescription_BasementKey
The key to NEW MAUVILLE, which\nwas constructed beneath MAUVILLE\nCITY.

#org @gItemDescription_AcroBike
A folding bicycle that is capable\nof stunts like jumps and wheelies.

#org @gItemDescription_PokeblockCase
A case for holding \P\K\B\L\CS made\nwith a BERRY BLENDER. It releases\none \P\K\B\L\C when shaken.

#org @gItemDescription_Letter
An extremely important letter to\nSTEVEN from the PRESIDENT of the\nDEVON CORPORATION.

#org @gItemDescription_EonTicket
The ticket required for sailing on a\nferry to a distant southern island.\nIt features a drawing of an island.

#org @gItemDescription_RedOrb
An orb that glows red.\nIt is said to contain an incredible\npower from ancient times.

#org @gItemDescription_BlueOrb
An orb that glows blue.\nIt is said to contain an incredible\npower from ancient times.

#org @gItemDescription_Scanner
A device used to search for\nlife-forms in water.\nIt looks too difficult to use.

#org @gItemDescription_GoGoggles
A pair of protective goggles.\nThey enable a TRAINER to travel\nthrough even desert sandstorms.

#org @gItemDescription_Meteorite
A meteorite that fell from space\nonto MT. MOON long ago.\nIt is very lumpy and hard.

#org @gItemDescription_Room1Key
A key that opens the door to Room\n1 inside the ABANDONED SHIP.\nIt is old and looks easily broken.

#org @gItemDescription_Room2Key
A key that opens the door to Room\n2 inside the ABANDONED SHIP.\nIt is old and looks easily broken.

#org @gItemDescription_Room4Key
A key that opens the door to Room\n4 inside the ABANDONED SHIP.\nIt is old and looks easily broken.

#org @gItemDescription_Room6Key
A key that opens the door to Room\n6 inside the ABANDONED SHIP.\nIt is old and looks easily broken.

#org @gItemDescription_StorageKey
A key that opens the storage hold\ninside the ABANDONED SHIP.\nIt is old and looks easily broken.

#org @gItemDescription_RootFossil
A fossil of an ancient, seafloor-\ndwelling POK\eMON. It appears to be\npart of a plant root.

#org @gItemDescription_ClawFossil
A fossil of an ancient, seafloor-\ndwelling POK\eMON. It appears to be\npart of a claw.

#org @gItemDescription_DevonScope
A scope that signals the presence\nof any unseeable POK\eMON.\nIt is made by the DEVON CORP.

#org @gItemDescription_TM01
An attack that is\nexecuted last.\nThe user flinches\nif hit beforehand.

#org @gItemDescription_TM02
Sharp, huge claws\nhook and slash the\nfoe quickly and\nwith great power.

#org @gItemDescription_TM03
An attack with a\npulsing blast of\nwater. It may also\nconfuse the foe.

#org @gItemDescription_TM04
The user focuses\nits mind to raise\nthe SP. ATK and\nSP. DEF stats.

#org @gItemDescription_TM05
The foe is made to\nswitch out with an\nally. In the wild,\nthe battle ends.

#org @gItemDescription_TM06
A move that badly\npoisons the foe.\nIts poison damage\nworsens every turn.

#org @gItemDescription_TM07
A hailstorm lasting\nfive turns damages\nall POK\eMON except\nthe ICE-type.

#org @gItemDescription_TM08
The user bulks up\nits body to boost\nboth its ATTACK and\nDEFENSE stats.

#org @gItemDescription_TM09
The user shoots\nseeds at the foe.\nTwo to five seeds\nare shot at once.

#org @gItemDescription_TM10
An attack that\nvaries in type and\nintensity depending\non the user.

#org @gItemDescription_TM11
The sun blazes for\nfive turns, powering\nup FIRE-type\nmoves.

#org @gItemDescription_TM12
The foe is taunted\ninto a rage that\nallows it to use\nonly attack moves.

#org @gItemDescription_TM13
The foe is struck\nwith an icy beam.\nIt may freeze the\nfoe solid.

#org @gItemDescription_TM14
The foe is blasted\nwith a blizzard.\nIt may freeze the\nfoe solid.

#org @gItemDescription_TM15
A severely damaging\nattack that makes\nthe user rest on\nthe next turn.

#org @gItemDescription_TM16
A wall of light\ncuts damage from\nSP. ATK attacks\nfor five turns.

#org @gItemDescription_TM17
Enables the user to\nevade all attacks.\nIt may fail if used\nin succession.

#org @gItemDescription_TM18
A heavy rain falls\nfor five turns,\npowering up WATER-\ntype moves.

#org @gItemDescription_TM19
A harsh attack that\nabsorbs half the\ndamage it inflicted\nto restore HP.

#org @gItemDescription_TM20
It protects the\nuser's party from\nall status problems\nfor five turns.

#org @gItemDescription_TM21
This attack move\ngrows more powerful\nthe less the user\nlikes its TRAINER.

#org @gItemDescription_TM22
A 2-turn move that\nblasts the foe with\nabsorbed energy in\nthe 2nd turn.

#org @gItemDescription_TM23
An attack with a\nsteel-hard tail.\nIt may lower the\nfoe's DEFENSE stat.

#org @gItemDescription_TM24
A strong electrical\nattack that may\nalso leave the foe\nparalyzed.

#org @gItemDescription_TM25
A brutal lightning\nattack that may\nalso leave the foe\nparalyzed.

#org @gItemDescription_TM26
An earthquake that\nstrikes all POK\eMON\nin battle excluding\nthe user.

#org @gItemDescription_TM27
This attack move\ngrows more powerful\nthe more the user\nlikes its TRAINER.

#org @gItemDescription_TM28
An attack that hits\non the 2nd turn.\nCan also be used\nto exit dungeons.

#org @gItemDescription_TM29
A strong telekinetic\nattack. It may also\nlower the foe's\nSP. DEF stat.

#org @gItemDescription_TM30
A shadowy blob is\nhurled at the foe.\nMay also lower the\nfoe's SP. DEF.

#org @gItemDescription_TM31
An attack that also\nbreaks any barrier\nlike LIGHT SCREEN\nand REFLECT.

#org @gItemDescription_TM32
The user creates\nillusory copies of\nitself to raise its\nevasiveness.

#org @gItemDescription_TM33
A wall of light\ncuts damage from\nphysical attacks\nfor five turns.

#org @gItemDescription_TM34
A rapid jolt of\nelectricity strikes\nthe foe. It can't\nbe evaded.

#org @gItemDescription_TM35
The foe is scorched\nwith intense flames.\nThe foe may suffer\na burn.

#org @gItemDescription_TM36
Filthy sludge is\nhurled at the foe.\nIt may poison the\ntarget.

#org @gItemDescription_TM37
A 5-turn sandstorm\nthat damages all\ntypes except ROCK,\nGROUND, and STEEL.

#org @gItemDescription_TM38
The foe is hit with\nan intense flame.\nIt may leave the\ntarget with a burn.

#org @gItemDescription_TM39
Boulders are hurled\nat the foe. It also\nlowers the foe's\nSPEED if it hits.

#org @gItemDescription_TM40
An extremely fast\nattack against one\ntarget. It can't be\nevaded.

#org @gItemDescription_TM41
It enrages the foe,\nmaking it incapable\nof using the same\nmove successively.

#org @gItemDescription_TM42
An attack that is\nboosted if user is\nburned, poisoned,\nor paralyzed.

#org @gItemDescription_TM43
An attack that may\nhave an additional\neffect that varies\nwith the terrain.

#org @gItemDescription_TM44
The user sleeps for\ntwo turns to fully\nrestore HP and heal\nany status problem.

#org @gItemDescription_TM45
If it is the other\ngender, the foe is\nmade infatuated and\nunlikely to attack.

#org @gItemDescription_TM46
An attack that may\ntake the foe's held\nitem if the user\nisn't holding one.

#org @gItemDescription_TM47
The foe is hit with\nwings of steel.\nIt may also raise\nthe user's DEFENSE.

#org @gItemDescription_TM48
The user employs\nits psychic power\nto swap abilities\nwith the foe.

#org @gItemDescription_TM49
Steals the effects\nof the foe's\nhealing or status-\nchanging move.

#org @gItemDescription_TM50
An intense attack\nthat also sharply\nreduces the user's\nSP. ATK stat.

#org @gItemDescription_Hm01Cut
A basic attack.\nIt can be used to\ncut down thin trees\nand grass.

#org @gItemDescription_Hm02Fly
A 2-turn move that\nhits on the 2nd\nturn. Use it to fly\nto any known town.

#org @gItemDescription_Hm03Surf
A big wave crashes\ndown on the foe.\nCan also be used\nfor crossing water.

#org @gItemDescription_Hm04Strength
The foe is slugged\nat maximum power.\nCan also be used\nto move boulders.

#org @gItemDescription_Hm05Flash
A blast of light\nthat cuts the foe's\naccuracy. It also\nilluminates caves.

#org @gItemDescription_Hm06RockSmash
An attack that may\nalso cut DEFENSE.\nIt can also smash\ncracked boulders.

#org @gItemDescription_Hm07Waterfall
A powerful charge\nattack. It can also\nbe used to climb\na waterfall.

#org @gItemDescription_Hm08RockClimb
The user dives\nunderwater on the\nfirst turn and\nstrikes next turn.

#org @gItemDescription_DynamaxBand
A Wishing Star has been affixed\nto it. It lets out a light that\nallows POK\eMON to Dynamax.

#org @gItemDescription_GoldTeeth
A set of false teeth lost by the\nSAFARI ZONE'S WARDEN. It makes his\nsmile sparkle.

#org @gItemDescription_OaksParcel
A parcel to be delivered to PROF.\nOAK from VIRIDIAN CITY's POK\eMON\nMART.

#org @gItemDescription_PokeFlute
A flute that is said to instantly\nawaken any POK\eMON. It has a\nlovely tone.

#org @gItemDescription_SecretKey
The key to CINNABAR ISLAND GYM's\nfront door. It is colored red and\ndecorated.

#org @gItemDescription_BikeVoucher
Take this voucher to the BIKE SHOP\nin CERULEAN CITY and exchange it\nfor a bicycle.

#org @gItemDescription_MegaRing
A ring which enables POK\eMON\nholding a Mega Stone to MEGA\nEVOLVE in battle.

#org @gItemDescription_OldAmber
A piece of amber that contains\nthe genes of an ancient POK\eMON.\nIt is clear with a reddish tint.

#org @gItemDescription_CardKey
A card-type key that unlocks doors\nin SILPH CO.'s HEAD OFFICE in\nSAFFRON CITY.

#org @gItemDescription_LiftKey
A key that operates the elevator\nin TEAM ROCKET's HIDEOUT.\nIt bears the TEAM ROCKET logo.

#org @gItemDescription_HelixFossil
A fossil of an ancient, seafloor-\ndwelling POK\eMON. It appears to be\npart of a seashell.

#org @gItemDescription_DomeFossil
A fossil of an ancient, seafloor-\ndwelling POK\eMON. It appears to be\npart of a shell.

#org @gItemDescription_SilphScope
A scope that makes unseeable\nPOK\eMON visible.\nIt is made by SILPH CO.

#org @gItemDescription_Bicycle
A folding bicycle that allows\nfaster movement than the RUNNING\nSHOES.

#org @gItemDescription_TownMap
A very convenient map that can be\nviewed anytime. It even shows your \npresent location.

#org @gItemDescription_VsSeeker
A device that indicates TRAINERS\nwho want to battle. The battery\ncharges while traveling.

#org @gItemDescription_FameChecker
A device that enables you to\nrecall what you've heard and seen\nabout famous people.

#org @gItemDescription_TMCase
A case that holds TMs and HMs.\nIt is attached to the BAG's\ncompartment for important items.

#org @gItemDescription_BerryPouch
A pouch for carrying BERRIES.\nIt is attached to the BAG's\ncompartment for important items.

#org @gItemDescription_TeachyTv
A television set that is tuned to\na program with useful tips for\nnovice TRAINERS.

#org @gItemDescription_TriPass
A pass for ferries between ONE,\nTWO, and THREE ISLAND.\nIt has a drawing of three islands.

#org @gItemDescription_RainbowPass
A pass for ferries between\nVERMILION and the SEVII ISLANDS.\nIt features a drawing of a rainbow.

#org @gItemDescription_Tea
An aromatic tea prepared by an old\nlady. It will slake even the worst\nthirst.

#org @gItemDescription_MysticTicket
A ticket required to board the ship\nto NAVEL ROCK.\nIt glows with a mystic light.

#org @gItemDescription_AuroraTicket
A ticket required to board the ship\nto BIRTH ISLAND.\nIt glows beautifully.

#org @gItemDescription_PowderJar
A jar for storing BERRY POWDER\nmade using a BERRY CRUSHER.

#org @gItemDescription_Ruby
An exquisitely beautiful gem that\nhas a red glow.\nIt symbolizes passion.

#org @gItemDescription_Sapphire
An exquisitely beautiful gem that\nhas a blue glow.\nIt symbolizes honesty.

