#org @gItemDescription_SkullFossil
A fossil from a prehistoric\nPOK\eMON that lived on the land. It\nappears to be part of a head.

#org @gItemDescription_ArmorFossil
A fossil from a prehistoric\nPOK\eMON that lived on the land. It\nappears to be part of a collar.

#org @gItemDescription_CoverFossil
A fossil of an ancient POK\eMON\nthat lived in the sea. It appears\nto be part of its back.

#org @gItemDescription_PlumeFossil
A fossil of an ancient POK\eMON\nthat flew in the sky. It appears\nto be part of its wing.

#org @gItemDescription_JawFossil
A fossil from an ancient POK\eMON\nthat once lived on the land. It\nlooks like a piece of large jaw.

#org @gItemDescription_SailFossil
A fossil from an ancient POK\eMON\nthat once lived on land. It looks\nlike the impression from a skin sail.

#org @gItemDescription_FossilizedBird
A fossil of an ancient POK\eMON\nthat soared through the sky.\nWhat it looked like is a mystery.

#org @gItemDescription_FossilizedFish
A fossil of an ancient POK\eMON\nthat once lived in the sea. What\nit looked like is a mystery.

#org @gItemDescription_FossilizedDrake
A fossil of an ancient POK\eMON\nthat once roamed the land. What\nit looked like is a mystery.

#org @gItemDescription_FossilizedDino
