#org @gItemDescription_LuckIncense
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nIt doubles the battle money if the\nholding POK\eMON takes part.

#org @gItemDescription_FullIncense
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nAn exotic incense that makes the\nholder bloated and slow moving.

#org @gItemDescription_OddIncense
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nThis exotic incense boosts the\npower of PSYCHIC-type moves.

#org @gItemDescription_PureIncense
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nIt repels wild POK\eMON if the\nholder is first in the party.

#org @gItemDescription_RockIncense
