#org @gItemDescription_WideLens
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nIt is a magnifying lens that boosts\nthe accuracy of moves.

#org @gItemDescription_MuscleBand
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nIt is a headband that slightly\nboosts the power of physical moves.

#org @gItemDescription_WiseGlasses
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nThis thick pair of glasses slightly\nboosts the power of special moves.

#org @gItemDescription_ExpertBelt
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nIt's a well-worn belt that boosts\nthe power of super effective moves.

#org @gItemDescription_LightClay
A hold item that extends the\nduration of moves like Reflect and\nLight Screen used by the holder.

#org @gItemDescription_LifeOrb
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nIt boosts the power of moves, at\nthe cost of some HP on each hit.

#org @gItemDescription_PowerHerb
A single-use item to be held by a\nPOK\eMON. It allows a charging move\non the first turn immediate usage.

#org @gItemDescription_ToxicOrb
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nIt is a bizzare orb that badly\npoisons the holder in battle.

#org @gItemDescription_FlameOrb
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nIt is a bizzare orb that inflicts a\nburn on the holder in battle.

#org @gItemDescription_QuickPowder
An item to be held by Ditto.\nExtremely fine yet hard, this odd\npowder boosts the Speed stat.

#org @gItemDescription_FocusSash
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nIf holder has full HP, it will\nendure a KO attack with 1 HP.

#org @gItemDescription_ZoomLens
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nIf the holder moves after the foe,\nits accuracy will be boosted.

#org @gItemDescription_Metronome
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nIt boosts moves used consecutively\nuntil a different move is used.

#org @gItemDescription_IronBall
A POK\eMON held item that cuts\nSpeed. It allows Ground-type moves\nto hit Flying and floating POK\eMON.  

#org @gItemDescription_LaggingTail
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nIt is tremendously heavy and makes\nthe holder move slower than usual.

#org @gItemDescription_DestinyKnot
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nIf the holder becomes infatuated,\nthe opposing POK\eMON will be, too.

#org @gItemDescription_BlackSludge
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nPoison-type POK\eMON regain HP,\nbut it damages any other type.

#org @gItemDescription_IcyRock
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nIt extends the duration of the move\nHail when used by the holder.

#org @gItemDescription_SmoothRock
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nIt extends the duration of the move\nSandstorm when used by the holder.

#org @gItemDescription_HeatRock
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nIt extends the duration of the move\nSunny Day when used by the holder.

#org @gItemDescription_DampRock
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nIt extends the duration of the move\nRain Dance when used by the holder.

#org @gItemDescription_GripClaw
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nIt extends the duration of multi-\nturn attacks like Bind or Wrap.

#org @gItemDescription_ChoiceScarf
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nThis scarf boosts Speed, but\nallows the use of only one move.

#org @gItemDescription_ChoiceSpecs
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nThese glasses raise Sp. Atk, but\nallows the use of only one move.

#org @gItemDescription_StickyBarb
A held item that damages the\nholder every turn and latches on\nto POK\eMON that touch the holder.        

#org @gItemDescription_ShedShell
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nThis carapace enables the holder to\nswitch out of battle without fail.

#org @gItemDescription_BigRoot
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nIt boosts the amount of HP \nrecovered from draining moves.            

#org @gItemDescription_Eviolite
A mysterious evolutionary lump.\nIt raises the Defense and Sp. Def\nof a POK\eMON that can evolve.

#org @gItemDescription_FloatStone
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nThis very light stone reduces the\nweight of a POK\eMON when held.

#org @gItemDescription_RockyHelmet
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nIf the holder is hit, the attacker\nwill also be damaged upon contact.

#org @gItemDescription_AirBalloon
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nThe holder floats in the air until\nhit. Once hit, this item will burst.

#org @gItemDescription_RedCard
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nIf the holder is hit by an attack,\nthe attacker is removed from battle.

#org @gItemDescription_RingTarget
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nMoves that normally have no effect\nwill land on a POK\eMON holding it.

#org @gItemDescription_BindingBand
An item to be held by a POK\eMON. A\nband that increases the power of\nbinding moves used by the holder.

#org @gItemDescription_AbsorbBulb
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nIt boosts Sp. Atk if hit with a\nWater-type attack once.

#org @gItemDescription_CellBattery
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nIt boosts Attack if hit with an\nElectric-type attack once.

#org @gItemDescription_EjectButton
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nIf the holder is hit by an attack,\nit will be switched out of battle.

#org @gItemDescription_WeaknessPolicy
An item to be held by a POK\eMON. \nAtk and Sp. Atk. increase if it is\nhit with a move it's weak to.

#org @gItemDescription_AssaultVest
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nThis vest raises Sp. Def but\nprevents the use of status moves.

#org @gItemDescription_LuminousMoss
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nIt boosts Sp. Def if hit with a\nWater-type attack once.

#org @gItemDescription_Snowball
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nIt boosts Attack if hit with an\nIce-type attack once.

#org @gItemDescription_SafetyGoggles
These goggles protect the holder \nfrom both weather-related damage\nand powder.

#org @gItemDescription_AdrenalineOrb
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nIt boosts Speed if the holder is\nintimidated.

#org @gItemDescription_TerrainExtender
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nIt extends the terrain duration of\nthe holder's move or ability.

#org @gItemDescription_ProtectivePads
An item that protects the holder\nfrom effects caused by making\ndirect contact with the enemy.            

#org @gItemDescription_ElectricSeed
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nIt boosts Defense on Electric\nTerrain. It can only be used once.

#org @gItemDescription_GrassySeed
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nIt boosts Defense on Grassy\nTerrain. It can only be used once.

#org @gItemDescription_MistySeed
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nIt boosts Sp. Defense on Misty\nTerrain. It can only be used once.

#org @gItemDescription_PsychicSeed
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nIt boosts Sp. Defense on Psychic\nTerrain. It can only be used once.

#org @gItemDescription_EjectPack
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nWhen stats are lowered, the holder\nwill be switched out of battle.

#org @gItemDescription_RoomService
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nIt lower's the holder's Speed when\nTrick Room takes effect.

#org @gItemDescription_BlunderPolicy
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nIt raises Speed when a POK\eMON\nmisses a move due to accuracy.

#org @gItemDescription_HeavyDutyBoots
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nThese boots prevent the effects of\ntraps set on the battlefield.

#org @gItemDescription_UtilityUmbrella
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nThis sturdy umbrella protects the\nholder from the effects of weather.

#org @gItemDescription_ThroatSpray
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nIt raises Sp. Atk when a POK\eMON\nuses a sound-based move.

#org @gItemDescription_AbilityCapsule
A capsule that allows a POK\eMON\nwith two Abilities to switch\nbetween these Abilities when used.

#org @gItemDescription_AbilityPatch
A patch that allows a POK\eMON with\na regular Ability to have a rare\nAbility.

#org @gItemDescription_Remedy
A herbal medicine that can restore\n60 HP. Yet the bitter taste will\nmake the POK\eMON less friendly.

#org @gItemDescription_FineRemedy
A herbal medicine that can restore\n100 HP. Yet the bitter taste will\nmake the POK\eMON less friendly.

#org @gItemDescription_SuperbRemedy
A herbal medicine that can restore\n150 HP. Yet the bitter taste will\nmake the POK\eMON less friendly.

#org @gItemDescription_MaxHoney
Honey that DYNAMAX VESPIQUEN\nproduces. It has the same\neffect as a MAX REVIVE.

#org @gItemDescription_JubilifeMuffin
A hidden gem gaining popularity in\nJUBILIFE VILLAGE. Can cure any\nstatus condition of a POK\eMON.

#org @gItemDescription_PewterCrunchies
PEWTER CITY's famous crunchy snack.\nThey can be used to cure any status\ncondition a POK\eMON may have.

#org @gItemDescription_SweetHeart
A piece of cloyingly sweet chocolate.\nIt can be used to restore 20 HP\nto a POK\eMON.

#org @gItemDescription_AbilityShield
An item to be held by a POK\eMON. It\nprotects the holder from having its\nability changed by others.

#org @gItemDescription_BoosterEnergy
Held item for POK\eMON with certain\nabilities. The energy of this capsule\nboosts the strength of the POK\eMON.

#org @gItemDescription_ClearAmulet
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nIt protects the holder from having\nits stats lowered by opposing POK\eMON.

#org @gItemDescription_CovertCloak
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nIt protects the holder from the\nadditional effects of moves.

#org @gItemDescription_FairyFeather
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nA faintly gleaming feather that\nboosts the power of FAIRY-type moves.

#org @gItemDescription_LoadedDice
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nIt can ensure that the holder's\nmultistrike moves hit more times.

#org @gItemDescription_MirrorHerb
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nThis herb will allow the holder to\nmirror a foe's stat increases once.

#org @gItemDescription_PunchingGlove
An item to be held by a POK\eMON.\nIt boosts the power of the holder's\npunching moves and prevents contact.

#org @gItemDescription_CornerstoneMask
